#: ../../contribute/index.md:5 969d3c1bbe2f419094a58d9217b6c933
msgid "🤝 Contribute"
msgstr "🤝 参与贡献"

#: ../../contribute/index.md:7 0f8314d5131948fc98aff2d6b968ab01
msgid "Welcome to the Contribute section of our documentation! Whether you're fixing bugs, adding features, or writing new modules, this guide will help you get started and align with our project's standards."
msgstr "欢迎来到文档的贡献指南！无论你是要修复问题、添加功能还是编写新模块，本指南都将帮助你快速入门并符合项目规范。"

#: ../../contribute/index.md:9 894b1f937c754741876f3144a995fd96
msgid "To contribute to this project, you must:"
msgstr "参与本项目贡献需满足以下条件："

#: ../../contribute/index.md:11 90862596fd8049ffb8476978319346ab
msgid "Know the structure of a Minecraft datapack (5-10 min to learn on internet)"
msgstr "了解Minecraft数据包结构（可通过网络学习，约5-10分钟）"

#: ../../contribute/index.md:12 ba3cca13f0664e63b13fe2f51704431a
msgid "Know the basic usage of git projects (20-30 min to learn on internet)"
msgstr "掌握Git基础操作（可通过网络学习，约20-30分钟）"

#: ../../contribute/index.md:13 f6b552cdf3df4c329533a2c4943ac994
msgid "Be accessible to answer questions about your work"
msgstr "能及时回应关于你工作的询问"

#: ../../contribute/index.md:15 f7a525e07c744a82890f403d008a7879
msgid "If you're not familiar with GitHub pull requests or open-source collaboration, we recommend this guide to help you get started quickly: [First Contributions Guide](https://github.com/firstcontributions/first-contributions/blob/main/README.md)."
msgstr "若不熟悉GitHub拉取请求或开源协作，推荐学习指南：[首次贡献指南](https://github.com/firstcontributions/first-contributions/blob/main/README.md)"

#: ../../contribute/index.md:17 d65ce666d93047838d5da3e701631b89
msgid "**For French speakers**"
msgstr "**致法语使用者**"

#: ../../contribute/index.md:19 64138c5ee1504307b3170cea7ed28e48
msgid "Ce projet est réalisé principalement par des membres francophones mais à destination d'un public international. C'est pourquoi toute la lib ainsi que la documentation est en anglais."
msgstr "该项目主要由法语使用者完成，但面向国际用户。因此，整个库和文档均使用英语。"

#: ../../contribute/index.md:21 ede353d3dc404ed2bdae809102f0068b
msgid "Si vous souhaitez contribuer mais que votre anglais n'est pas au niveau, vous pouvez utiliser des outils comme [DeepL](https://DeepL.com) puis demander une vérification."
msgstr "如果你希望参与贡献但英语水平尚不足，可以使用 [DeepL](https://DeepL.com) 等工具，再请他人协助校对。"
